title: Giant Steps
key: B
tempo: 240
style: jazz

// Sixteen bars through three keys a major third apart: B, G and E-flat.
// Two chords a bar for most of it, each new key reached by its own five or
// two-five, as fast as the band goes.
[A]
| Bmaj7 D7  | Gmaj7 Bb7  | Ebmaj7 | Am7 D7   |
| Gmaj7 Bb7 | Ebmaj7 F#7 | Bmaj7  | Fm7 Bb7  |
| Ebmaj7    | Am7 D7     | Gmaj7  | C#m7 F#7 |
| Bmaj7     | Fm7 Bb7    | Ebmaj7 | C#m7 F#7 |
